- [ ] `pnpm build` succeeds; zero new `any`; every new file under 150 lines
- [ ] One git commit per task

## Invariants Produced (frozen for S03-S06)

1. `bartender` is the only role string permitted in DB CHECKs and TS unions; `BARMAN` is a UI
   display label only.
2. `refund_process` is a legal `orders.payment_status`. State is never again encoded in
   `orders.notes`.
3. `public.venue_settings` is the sole authority for venue timezone, service-time target and role
   baselines. No code may hardcode UTC or the 30-minute threshold again.
4. Every plpgsql function is invoked through `server/utils/rpc.ts` `callRpc`. Direct
   `supabase.rpc()` calls are forbidden.
5. Every exactly-once write uses `server/utils/idempotency.ts` against a UNIQUE index. No write
   path may rely on read-then-insert.
6. Routes handling PII, money or stock call `requireTrustedActor` from `server/utils/actor.ts`.
   Client-asserted `userRole` is tolerated only on pre-existing routes.
7. Every table created from migration 031 onward carries
   `restaurant_id TEXT REFERENCES restaurants(id) DEFAULT 'default-restaurant'`.
8. `order_items` line uniqueness is enforced in the database. S04 may only *widen* the index,
   never introduce uniqueness from scratch.
9. Shared domain types live in `_app/reda/types/`. Duplicating an interface across components is
   prohibited.
10. The permission-key set is frozen. No sprint adds a key to fewer than five role blocks.
11. Scheduled work lives under `server/api/cron/`, is guarded by `CRON_SECRET`, and is registered
    in `vercel.json` `crons`.
12. Migration numbering continues at **031**.

## Open Questions — ANSWERED 2026-08-13

1. **`CRON_SECRET`** — ❌ **DEFERRED.** The three-variable lock at S01:67-73 stands. S02-T17 drops
   from this sprint (`status: BLOCKED`, no approval given). P5/P6 scheduled evaluation becomes an
   admin-triggered POST; S06 must absorb this. Invariant 11 is **void as written** — rewrite at
   close.
2. **Vocabulary** — ✅ `bartender` wins as the wire value; `BARMAN` is a UI display label only.
   Recorded as Decision B in S02-T01.
3. **Venue timezone seed** — ✅ `Europe/Kyiv`.
4. **Loyalty scope** — ✅ **per-`restaurant_id`**, decided 2026-08-14 under delegated authority.
   Recorded in `REDA/docs/DECISIONS/S02-loyalty-scope.md`. Rationale: per-venue aggregates up to
   global, global cannot be split back down. S03 unblocked on this point.

